i>Disappear from Polizia</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888830/extras/3216542ca27ce79eadedb643ad6fc11d.poster.avif?t=1760198781\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888830/extras/3216542ca27ce79eadedb643ad6fc11d.webm?t=1760198781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888830/extras/3216542ca27ce79eadedb643ad6fc11d.mp4?t=1760198781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></p>", "short_description": "The checkpoint-themed roguelike. Smuggle weird stuff, troll the cops, and save your sweet granny.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888830/d3cef4b5c798ce99143c2b9c465a930d2b086a15/header.jpg?t=1760198781", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888830/24b4ebf828b99c1bbbf6d5fd6411f7e60325c8dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760198781", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888830/24b4ebf828b99c1bbbf6d5fd6411f7e60325c8dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760198781", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core 3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 950  or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["IOX"], "publishers": ["IOX"], "package_groups": []